{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "956b70153d355ca6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "每个成员都需要在正式开发之前配置好，记住是每个人！！！\n因为这是本地的操作。",
      "x": -265,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 485,
      "height": 59,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b010819f4177e600",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "media/da6d8728f4ad/UnityYAML%20Merge_002.png",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 185,
      "width": 573,
