      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2411ee672bf8028f",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "media/eabf9a08d238/UnityYAML%20Merge_003.png",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 573,
      "height": 369,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "feb75d84d7c2b4a9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "根据路径XXXXX/Editor/Data/Tools\n往下找就找的到了",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b0d204d56162bb1",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "media/1709ab9e24f1/UnityYAML%20Merge_001.png",
      "x": -523,
      "y": 835,
      "width": 588,
      "height": 440,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "f54c66f5d3794f3a",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "media/962495835ade/UnityYAML%20Merge_004.png",
      "x": -565,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 673,
      "height": 380
    },
    {
      "id": "06522bdacd60f465",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "参数：merge -p \"$REMOTE\" \"$BASE\" \"$LOCAL\" \"$MERGED\"（或者让AI给你）",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 1241,
      "width": 336,
      "height": 69,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "3ace4b25b71528ae",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "但是现在呢Unity2022以上的版本默认都是Force Text了，你们检查一下就行",
      "x": -415,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 374,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c819668c08cadbe",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "UnityYAML Merge是Unity自带的一个智能合并工具，需要自己手动开启，是专门用来合并Scene，Prefab等资源文件的，专门用来解决scene/prefab冲突，因为这些基本没法手动更改。\n\n举个简单的例子，如果成员A对物体修改了位置，成员B对物体添加了脚本，后续合并的时候可能会冲突爆炸。\n\n无论怎么样，主场景最好还是一个人负责，其他人就各自在自己的分支场景上开发功能就可以了。如果搭配一个Persistent Scene+多个Addictive Scenes开发模式更好\n\n",
      "x": -365,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 686,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
